1
00:00:05,384 --> 00:00:06,424
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

2
00:00:06,594 --> 00:00:10,684
(Leonard:)-Sheldon, you got a minute?
-Of course, my good friend. Come in.

3
00:00:11,641 --> 00:00:13,141
Yeah, help me out.

4
00:00:13,309 --> 00:00:17,399
(Sheldon:)Which ski hat says,
"Après Super Collider"?

5
00:00:19,273 --> 00:00:21,403
(Scene:)Sheldon,
I'm not taking you to Switzerland.

6
00:00:21,567 --> 00:00:24,277
(Sheldon:)Well, of course you are.
Who else would you take?

7
00:00:24,737 --> 00:00:27,327
(Raj:)-Penny.
-What? That's absurd.

8
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:30,910
(Sheldon:)Penny has no interest
in subatomic particle research.

9
00:00:31,285 --> 00:00:33,785
(Leonard:)Yes, but it'll be Valentine's Day.

10
00:00:33,955 --> 00:00:38,085
(Leonard:)We can go sightseeing and skiing
and make love in front of a roaring fire...

11
00:00:38,251 --> 00:00:40,961
(Leonard:)...in the shadow
of the snow-capped Alps.

12
00:00:42,588 --> 00:00:45,798
(Sheldon:)But Penny has no interest
in subatomic particle research.

13
00:00:46,634 --> 00:00:48,054
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, Sheldon.

14
00:00:48,219 --> 00:00:52,099
(Sheldon:)Sorry? I've been dreaming about
going to the Large Hadron Collider...

15
00:00:52,265 --> 00:00:53,805
...since I was 9 years old.

16
00:00:53,975 --> 00:00:58,605
(Leonard:)I've been dreaming about spending
Valentine's with a girl since I was 6.

17
00:00:59,021 --> 00:01:01,061
(Sheldon:)Shame on you.

